{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌神陳奕迅（Eason）與徐濠縈的愛女陳康堤，早前證實與香港網球一哥黃澤林（Coleman）結束半年情。</p><p>男方隨後傳出火速撻着女神譚旻萱（Mandy），引發「無縫接軌」猜測。</p><p>事後有眼利網民發現，Eason一家三口已全數Unfollow黃澤林社</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T10:16:24.589659+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T10:01:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:09:35.630117+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T10:09:35.630117+00:00","content_hash":"719bbdb9aef8120e8437af6f3de300d0876b43fe103a2933093633ab1465e45a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}